[V:LH] (^C/D/E/D/ .C) z | [K:clef=treble] (D/E/F/G/ .A) (G | FED^D | E=DCB,) |
[V:RH] !p!(A/B/c/B/ .A) z | (A/B/c/d/ .e) z | (d/e/f/g/ .a) z | (a/b/c'/d'/ .e') z |
[V:LH] [K:clef=bass] [A,CE]2 [A,CE]2 | [A,CE]2 [A,CE]2 | [A,DF]2 [A,DF]2 | [A,CE]2 [A,CE]2 |
[V:RH] z .B (Bc | A2 e2- | e) .B (Bc |1 A4) :|2 (A/B/c/B/ .A) z ||
[V:LH] [A,DE]2 [A,DE]2 | [A,CE]2 [A,CE]2 | [A,DE]2 [A,DE]2 |1 [A,CE]2 [A,CE]2 :|2 [A,CE]2 [A,CE]2 ||
